imited number of in-game days.<br><strong>Casual</strong>: Experience the story at your own pace with no limitations, and less challenge.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>a hand-crafted Open World<br></li><li>8 Playable Party Members<br></li><li>over 100 Unique Enemies<br></li><li>low damage numbers<br></li><li>no random Encounters<br></li><li>no cluttered inventory<br></li><li>Upgrade your Basecamp<br></li><li>original Soundtrack By Floopy</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/extras/d142e6710005b00754b949e10725ef6c.avif?t=1735930838\" /></div></li></ul>",
